{"step_index":835,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-13T15:08:35Z","input_tokens":2699,"cache_read_tokens":203180,"output_tokens":738,"content":"Error `Failed to read app source directory (No such file or directory)` artinya **Dokploy gagal mengunduh/menemukan file kodingan dari repository GitHub Anda**.\n\nPenyebab utamanya ada 2 hal di pengaturan **Dokploy**:\n\n---\n\n### 1. Nama Branch Berbeda (Paling Sering!) ⚠️\nDi repository GitHub Anda ([`Haqi25/m-one-codekids`](https://github.com/Haqi25/m-one-codekids)), nama branchnya memakai huruf kapital: **`Main`** (huruf **`M`** besar).\n\nKarena Dokploy berjalan di sistem Linux (yang sensitif huruf besar/kecil):\n1. Buka aplikasi Anda di Dokploy → masuk ke tab **General** (atau tab **Source / Git**).\n2. Cari kolom **Branch**.\n3. Jika tertulis `main` (huruf kecil) atau `master`, **ganti menjadi `Main` (huruf M besar)**.\n4. Klik **Save**.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Kolom \"Base Directory\"\n1. Masih di tab yang sama di Dokploy, cari kolom **Base Directory** (atau **Root Directory / Work Directory**).\n2. Pastikan kolom tersebut **DIKOSONGKAN** (atau isi cukup tanda **`/`**). Jangan diisi nama folder lain, karena file `package.json` Anda berada langsung di folder utama repository.\n3. Klik **Save**.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Izin Akses Repository (Jika Repo Private)\n- Jika repository GitHub Anda disetel **Private**, pastikan akun GitHub Anda sudah dihubungkan ke Dokploy (*Connected Git Provider*) atau repo disetel ke **Public** sementara agar Dokploy bisa mengunduh file tanpa hambatan.\n\n---\n\nSetelah mengecek 3 hal di atas, klik tombol **Deploy** lagi di Dokploy. Nixpacks akan langsung berhasil mendeteksi aplikasi Next.js Anda! 🚀","thinking":"The error indicates the application source directory is not found, leading to an \"os error 2.\" This points to a likely mismatch between the branch name in the user's GitHub repository (`Main`) and the branch name expected by Dokploy (potentially `main`). This discrepancy prevents Dokploy from locating the application code.\n\n\n"}
